msgstr "Paste the domains you want to watch: domains you'd like to buy, try to catch when they drop, or just keep an eye on. %s checks each one in the background with public RDAP data (or WHOIS where a TLD has no RDAP), and shows its expiry date, registrar, statuses, and where it is in the expiry and deletion cycle. The registries see which domains are being checked."

