#: watch/edit.php:121
msgid "This estimate uses the domain's statuses and the TLD's usual rules. The owner can usually renew during the grace period and restore during redemption, so the domain may never drop. When deletion is pending, it usually can't be restored. Popular names are often caught by paid backorder services the moment they drop, or never become available to register at all."
msgstr "This estimate uses the domain's statuses and the TLD's usual rules. The owner can usually renew during the grace period and restore during redemption, so the domain may never drop. When deletion is pending, it usually can't be restored. Popular names are often caught by paid backorder services the moment they drop, or never become available to register at all."

